{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14311","headline":"东都嘉量亭献留守韩仆射 · 窦庠","name":"东都嘉量亭献留守韩仆射","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卜筑三川上，仪刑万井中。\n度材垂後俭，选胜揜前功。\n云构中央起，烟波四面通。\n乍疑游汗漫，稍似入崆垌。\n廛閈高低尽，山河表里穷。\n峰恋从地碧，宫观倚天红。\n灵槛如朝蜃，飞桥状晚虹。\n曙霞晴错落，夕霭湿葱茏。\n庾亮楼何厄，陈蕃榻更崇。\n有时闲讲德，永日静观风。\n玉斝飞无算，金铙奏未终。\n重筵开玳瑁，上客集鵷鸿。\n接武空慙蹇，修文敢并雄。\n岂须登岘首，然後奉羊公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦庠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14311.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14311","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}